Z||000000||Springtyme||11-25-2001||04:42 PM||||Well I got a spiffy little metal plate that goes over my third brake light and makes it light up "FIERO" on ebay, unknowingly bought it (well, won it) and I love it. Anyway, I got an email from an ebay user who informed me that Rodney Dickman sold the original one (and it also costs a whole lot less than the one I got) so here is a great gift idea for those of you that you love and drive a fiero, and also blatently promoting Rodney since I screwed up =(<BR> <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/retail.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com/retail.html</A> <P>go to exterior and then click on Third Brake Light Mask. Only 15 bucks (3 dollars s/h)<P>Okay, I'm done now =) Sorry again Rodney!!!!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> ||||reg||3
